    "identifier": "beast-fist-graceful-cat",
    "description": "<p>You focus chakra throughout your muscles enhancing your physical Dexterity and Cunning. For the duration, your Dexterity ability score becomes 18 if they are lower than 18. You do not suffer fall damage from falls less than 30 feet. Additionally, your movement speed is increased by +10 feet.</p>\n<p>When you would cast a Taijutsu with the Combo keyword, you gain +10 bonus to your movement speed until the end of the turn you cast it.</p>",
